<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Space Exploration Guide</title>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>Space Exploration Guide</h1>
    <p>Discover the exciting world of space through different types of HTML lists.</p>

    <h2>Steps to Become an Astronaut</h2>

    <!-- Ordered List -->
    <ol>
        <li>Study mathematics and science</li>
        <li>Maintain physical fitness</li>
        <li>Complete professional training</li>
        <li>Learn how spacecraft operate</li>
        <li>Prepare for a space mission</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Amazing Objects in Space</h2>

    <!-- Unordered List -->
    <ul>
        <li>Saturn - Famous for its beautiful rings</li>
        <li>Mars - Known as the Red Planet</li>
        <li>Jupiter - The largest planet</li>
        <li>Moon - Earth's natural satellite</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Important Space Terms</h2>

    <!-- Description List -->
    <dl>
        <dt>Galaxy</dt>
        <dd>A massive collection of stars, gas, and dust.</dd>

        <dt>Asteroid</dt>
        <dd>A rocky object that travels around the Sun.</dd>

        <dt>Satellite</dt>
        <dd>An object that revolves around a planet.</dd>

        <dt>Gravity</dt>
        <dd>A force that attracts objects towards each other.</dd>
    </dl>

</body>

</html>
